@Ping for Everything @Ping for Essentials

@Metta has been working on a pretty cool database, i can show a small bit for now.

The plan is to make this a server where everyone can contribute, and while the database stills work in progress, i wanna share a look at how it is.

The database includes fields to discuss and add notes about what needs buffs, nerfs or fixes, tabs for skills, mobs, maps and so much more, all easy to find and provide feedback on.

WORK IN PROGRESS, TAKE WITH A GRAIN OF SALT.
